# README media: MANDIBLES
shotscale 2
seed 46
game mandibles
wait 90
shot mandibles_title
# the road to the capital, halfway along; the leader walks to the next field
cheat won 107
press A
wait 30
press UP
wait 16
shot mandibles_map
wait 30
press A
wait 240
shot mandibles_brief
# a squad on the twin mounds, the command cross open
cheat mission 6 3
botplay 2600
hold A
wait 12
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
wait 8
shot mandibles_menu
release A
# the demo player on the dew ditch: sap home, a squad, a longlegs
cheat mission 5 1
botplay 1500
gifstart mandibles 3 2
botplay 900
gifstop
shot mandibles_field
# brawls: ants that touch fight in a cloud of dust
cheat mission 1 3
cheat clear
cheat red_store 0
cheat at 150 60
cheat unit 2 0 44 110
cheat tag_order 0 2
cheat unit 3 0 170 70
cheat unit 2 1 174 70
cheat unit 2 0 196 50
cheat unit 2 1 200 50
wait 20
